<title>USA: Telular Corp names thomas Mason CFO.</title>
<headline>Telular Corp names thomas Mason CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO GROVE, Ill. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telular Corp said Thursday it appointed Thomas Mason senior vice president and chief financial officer replacing Frank Brink who resigned to pursue other business interests.</p>
<p>Mason, a certified public accountant and experienced public accounting professional, has held a variety of senior management positions in both finance and general management.</p>
<p>Shares of the telecommunications interface technology company fell 1/4 to 5-7/8 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
